WEBVTT

00:05:26.875 --> 00:05:30.417
and to indict the systems of neglect
that created these conditions.

00:05:31.542 --> 00:05:35.833
(Applause)

00:05:36.583 --> 00:05:38.518
So what is Ghetto Gastro?

00:05:38.542 --> 00:05:42.309
Ultimately, it's a movement
and a philosophy.

00:05:42.333 --> 00:05:45.851
We view the work we do as gastrodiplomacy,

00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:48.268
using food and finesse

00:05:48.292 --> 00:05:51.167
to open borders and connect culture.

00:05:52.458 --> 00:05:54.559
Last year in Tokyo,

00:05:54.583 --> 00:05:57.809
we did a Caribbean patty,

00:05:57.833 --> 00:06:00.226
we do jerk wagyu beef,